WEBVTT

00:01.980 --> 00:05.110
Lucy-Wucy!
It's your daddy!

00:05.110 --> 00:06.610
Hurray!

00:08.610 --> 00:11.040
Ah, she is so cute.

00:11.040 --> 00:15.240
Is there anything in the world
as adorable as her smile?

00:15.700 --> 00:20.000
If there are angels in this world,
she would be one.

00:20.000 --> 00:21.880
Hey, Rudeus.

00:21.880 --> 00:25.250
At least, let me soothe the little lady
when she fusses.

00:25.250 --> 00:29.340
Please don't take my blissful moments,
Suzanne.

00:29.340 --> 00:32.640
Well, if you really want to
do it yourself, I don't mind.

00:32.640 --> 00:35.260
Is there any man who doesn't
want to do it?

00:35.260 --> 00:38.190
My husband doesn't.

00:38.190 --> 00:42.540
Is Timothy lacking awareness
that he's a father?

00:43.270 --> 00:45.150
Isn't that right, Lucy?

00:45.150 --> 00:47.400
You sure have changed.

00:47.400 --> 00:52.170
But still, I was surprised when I found out
that you moved to Sharia.

00:52.170 --> 00:53.610
Me too.

00:53.610 --> 00:57.600
I never expected that you were married
and already had a daughter.

00:58.530 --> 01:01.080
So the party is already dissolved?

01:01.080 --> 01:02.270
Yeah.

01:02.270 --> 01:05.129
Not long after you left.

01:05.129 --> 01:09.880
It gets tough when a mediocre party
like ours loses a member.

01:12.490 --> 01:14.640
How about Sara?

01:14.640 --> 01:16.310
Are you curious?

01:16.310 --> 01:18.430
Yeah, a little.

01:18.430 --> 01:21.380
She's still out there as an adventurer.

01:22.350 --> 01:25.670
If you have something to say,
it's better to do that sooner.

01:25.670 --> 01:28.480
We don't know when an adventurer
meets their end.

01:30.330 --> 01:34.240
No, there's nothing I need to say to her.

01:35.100 --> 01:36.740
Is that so?

01:37.730 --> 01:40.080
Pardon us, Master Rudeus.

01:40.080 --> 01:44.700
Madam is a bit worried about Lady Lucy,
so I brought her here.

01:44.700 --> 01:48.550
Mom, Lucy is doing great today.

01:52.550 --> 01:56.030
Lucy really loves her grandma,
doesn't she?

02:05.510 --> 02:08.570
Pardon me, Master Rudeus.

02:10.320 --> 02:13.200
Okay, okay, what is it?

02:13.630 --> 02:15.700
Is the diaper wet?

02:16.680 --> 02:19.800
Oh, looks like she's hungry.

02:22.630 --> 02:27.330
Don't tell me, she noticed
that Lucy was hungry?

02:28.170 --> 02:31.840
If this is a sign of recovery,
that's a good thing.

02:41.950 --> 02:45.350
Thank you for accepting
this job for today.

02:45.350 --> 02:48.400
Because it was none other
than your request.

02:48.400 --> 02:53.990
Still, it's amazing that Princess Ranoa
asked you to be her escort.

02:53.990 --> 02:56.240
It's just a coincidence.

02:56.240 --> 03:00.710
When a member of the Ranoan royal family
reaches adulthood,

03:00.710 --> 03:04.160
they have to make a journey
around the country as a trial.

03:04.690 --> 03:08.010
The journey itself wasn't
anything too difficult.

03:08.010 --> 03:11.210
They just have to hire their own people.

03:12.060 --> 03:16.390
The members of the hired adventurer's party
are sick and absent, right?

03:16.390 --> 03:20.680
Yes, and we are their replacements.

03:20.680 --> 03:23.920
I heard that Princess Ariel
is coming along, too.

03:23.920 --> 03:27.810
It seems she wants to establish
a connection with Princess Ranoa.

03:27.810 --> 03:29.830
She's amazing.

03:29.830 --> 03:34.190
Even if it's for a connection, she dares
to go to a monster-infested forest.

03:34.190 --> 03:39.660
Personally, since the number of nobles
being escorted increased to two,

03:39.660 --> 03:42.560
it makes things more difficult
and causes me a bit of anxiety.

03:44.290 --> 03:48.330
That's why, having you here
makes me feel at ease.

03:48.760 --> 03:51.170
Just think of it as a relaxing stroll.

03:51.170 --> 03:53.000
I'm counting on you.

03:53.000 --> 03:59.010
MUSHOKU TENSEI: JOBLESS REINCARNATION SEASON 3

04:01.470 --> 04:04.180
Really?
They have them in Asura, too?

04:04.180 --> 04:07.440
Yes, we have gardens inside the palace.

04:07.440 --> 04:10.880
Turns out it's the same everywhere, isn't it?

04:11.800 --> 04:12.940
How very interesting.

04:14.050 --> 04:17.140
Who are you people?
State your names at once.

04:17.140 --> 04:21.290
Pleased to meet you.
My name is Roxy Migurdia Greyrat.

04:21.290 --> 04:22.950
I'm Rudeus Greyrat.

04:22.950 --> 04:26.530
Lady Grace,
they are the people I told you.

04:26.530 --> 04:29.710
They will replace the sick members
as the Princess's escort.

04:30.510 --> 04:33.130
Oh, so it's you two.

04:33.630 --> 04:35.500
I've been noticed before.

04:35.500 --> 04:37.740
I am Grace, a royal knight.

04:37.740 --> 04:39.710
We appreciate your help.

04:39.710 --> 04:43.410
We were told you'd hired
a party of adventurers, as well?

04:43.410 --> 04:46.680
An adventurer's party called
the Amazons Ace.

04:46.680 --> 04:48.660
They should be back right now.

04:48.660 --> 04:50.560
Come on, just go along with it!

04:50.560 --> 04:53.830
Just go along? Did you forget
what happened last time?

04:53.830 --> 04:57.730
Those idiots screwed up so badly
and nearly got Tina and Melanie killed!

04:57.730 --> 04:59.540
I'm not okay with this!

04:59.540 --> 05:02.530
We have no choice.
That's what they want.

05:02.530 --> 05:06.330
I'd rather do this by myself
than with random strangers.

05:06.330 --> 05:12.290
I'm not arrogant enough
to let you watch our back alone.

05:12.290 --> 05:16.690
You've got to learn how to work
with other people, you know.

05:16.690 --> 05:17.840
I'm fine for now.

05:17.840 --> 05:21.530
It's not like I will stay
in the same party forever.

05:28.530 --> 05:29.730
Oh, it's you.

05:29.730 --> 05:31.530
Who? Do you know him?

05:31.530 --> 05:33.190
Well, kinda...

05:37.190 --> 05:38.730
Sara.

05:38.730 --> 05:42.040
There's no way I could ever forget her.

05:42.040 --> 05:47.950
A strong-willed, straightforward girl,
and also a clever one.

05:47.950 --> 05:52.870
After going on a few quests together,
I started to develop feelings for her.

05:53.390 --> 05:55.700
Or maybe she was the one
who fell for me?

05:56.630 --> 06:00.300
On the other hand, I don't really
understand how I felt about her.

06:00.880 --> 06:05.300
Because our relationship ended quickly
before I could really figure that out.

06:05.300 --> 06:07.550
Yes, it's all in the past.

06:08.050 --> 06:11.230
And I won't see her again.

06:11.810 --> 06:14.230
But it turned out different
from what I thought.

06:15.700 --> 06:18.860
Alisa! Sara!
There are two heading your way!

06:18.860 --> 06:22.530
Let the great protection of fire
be on the place thou seekest.

06:22.530 --> 06:25.280
I call the bold heat of a torch
here and now.

06:25.280 --> 06:26.990
Fireball!

06:30.830 --> 06:33.910
May this small, smoldering fire
call forth a great and searing blessing!

06:34.320 --> 06:35.870
Flamethrower!

06:50.390 --> 06:52.760
Is everything okay over there?

06:52.760 --> 06:53.770
We're okay.

07:05.200 --> 07:09.730
Wow, we won easily this time.

07:09.730 --> 07:13.580
The professor of the University of Magic
who made it through the Teleportation Labyrinth.

07:13.580 --> 07:15.420
Looks like the rumors were true, huh?

07:15.420 --> 07:19.190
Splitting the focus between offensive
and healing magic was amazing!

07:19.190 --> 07:23.000
I never thought I'd be able to see someone
who can do that in real combat!

07:23.000 --> 07:24.560
I'm surprised you can say that.

07:24.560 --> 07:28.360
Didn't you say, "I don't want
to work with this kid"?

07:28.360 --> 07:30.510
I'm sorry for underestimating you!

07:30.510 --> 07:33.680
It's okay.
It happens all the time.

07:33.680 --> 07:38.760
Seeing Roxy get praised by others
really warms my heart.

07:39.750 --> 07:42.010
That's my teacher, you know.

07:46.690 --> 07:50.990
Okay, before the princesses' group returns,
let's get the food ready!

07:50.990 --> 07:53.710
- Hey, Rudeus...
- Let me handle the cooking!

07:53.710 --> 07:55.910
I wasn't much use in the battle anyway.

07:55.910 --> 07:57.490
But...

07:57.490 --> 08:00.920
Leave it to me.
I'm actually pretty good at cooking.

08:00.920 --> 08:03.440
Is she his ex-girlfriend?

08:03.440 --> 08:05.980
Do you know something?

08:05.980 --> 08:08.300
I do know a little bit.

08:10.050 --> 08:13.180
On the way home, there's a chance
we might run into monsters.

08:13.180 --> 08:14.880
- Just let me know if there's
- If possible, I'd like him to stay focused.

08:14.880 --> 08:16.680
- anything I can do to help!
- If possible, I'd like him to stay focused.

08:19.140 --> 08:21.920
So, this pilgrimage is going smoothly, then?

08:21.920 --> 08:22.940
Yes.

08:22.940 --> 08:27.220
Thanks to you, this pilgrimage
will be a pleasant experience.

08:27.220 --> 08:28.990
I'm glad to hear that.

08:28.990 --> 08:33.429
Big Sis, could you teach me
some magic during this trip?

08:33.429 --> 08:35.280
I don't mind.

08:35.280 --> 08:36.200
Yes!

08:36.200 --> 08:37.919
Thank you, Big Sis!

08:37.919 --> 08:40.690
Calling me Big Sis is a bit...

08:41.280 --> 08:45.170
Uh, the atmosphere here is
worlds apart from Roxy's.

08:45.170 --> 08:47.110
I want to join them.

08:47.110 --> 08:50.590
I also want Roxy to call me Big Bro.

08:50.590 --> 08:53.310
Rudy, she's your acquaintance, right?

08:54.120 --> 08:56.330
Why don't you at least talk to her?

08:56.330 --> 08:59.460
I get it, but...

09:00.330 --> 09:04.350
Ah, my throat's getting dry.

09:04.350 --> 09:07.560
Some yellow fruits were growing
around the road, weren't there?

09:07.560 --> 09:11.690
I hate to be a bother,
but I want to eat that.

09:11.690 --> 09:13.820
Could you please pick one for me?

09:17.330 --> 09:19.870
I understand.
I will get it for you.

09:20.400 --> 09:23.940
Walking alone in the forest
is not a good idea.

09:23.940 --> 09:28.130
Rudeus and Fitz,
please keep her company.

09:28.130 --> 09:32.870
Is this her way to make room
for me to clear things?

09:32.870 --> 09:33.990
But...

09:33.990 --> 09:36.800
I think Rudy can handle it by himself.

09:37.260 --> 09:40.020
I'll stay here with you,
Princess Ariel.

09:40.020 --> 09:41.760
Are you sure?

09:41.760 --> 09:43.020
It's fine.

09:43.020 --> 09:44.910
He won't run away.

09:48.280 --> 09:52.140
That's right.
I was running away.

09:55.780 --> 09:58.880
I can't keep running away
like this, can I?

09:59.410 --> 10:02.160
Rudeus, will you do it?

10:04.270 --> 10:05.280
Yes.

10:18.610 --> 10:21.020
So you kept going as an adventurer?

10:21.680 --> 10:23.230
What do you mean by that?

10:24.620 --> 10:26.980
I heard Counter Arrow has disbanded.

10:26.980 --> 10:30.690
Suzanne and Timothy got married
and quit being adventurers, right?

10:31.200 --> 10:35.620
I also heard that Patrice went back to
the Asura Kingdom to become a soldier.

10:40.750 --> 10:42.630
What about you, Sara?

10:42.630 --> 10:44.960
I bounced around a lot of parties
for a while.

10:44.960 --> 10:48.800
But I've been with them
ever since I reached A-rank.

10:48.800 --> 10:51.840
This is the first time I've seen a party
made up entirely of women.

10:51.840 --> 10:55.340
There are a lot of them
in the lower ranks.

10:55.340 --> 10:59.280
Once you reach C-rank and above,
ability is more important than gender.

10:59.280 --> 11:01.120
So it's not too common.

11:01.120 --> 11:02.350
I see.

11:02.350 --> 11:05.170
This is my first time in one myself,

11:05.170 --> 11:07.610
but it has a lot of merits
to be in an all-female group.

11:07.610 --> 11:10.730
Sometimes clients prefer us.

11:10.730 --> 11:15.110
Escorting the Princess really works well
when the party is all women.

11:16.570 --> 11:18.660
It's also more relaxing.

11:18.660 --> 11:21.910
There won't be any romantic drama,
after all.

11:28.850 --> 11:30.670
What about you?

11:31.120 --> 11:32.280
What do you mean?

11:32.280 --> 11:34.430
I heard you're married, have a kid,

11:34.430 --> 11:37.120
and live in harmony with
your wives every day.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.890
That's what Suzanne told me.

11:38.890 --> 11:40.550
Well...

11:42.150 --> 11:42.890
I'm sorry.

11:42.890 --> 11:45.490
I'm not asking you to apologize!

12:05.250 --> 12:06.580
Sara.

12:07.070 --> 12:09.760
I know you don't want me to apologize.

12:09.760 --> 12:11.460
But I'm going to do it anyway.

12:11.460 --> 12:15.890
Because the way we parted ways
was not the best.

12:15.890 --> 12:19.940
I don't know what to say either when running
into you like this out of the blue.

12:19.940 --> 12:22.970
But that's no right for me
to keep ignoring you.

12:23.580 --> 12:24.640
I'm sorry.

12:25.380 --> 12:29.730
I already told you,
I don't want your apology.

12:30.950 --> 12:32.820
Can I sit next to you?

12:32.820 --> 12:36.000
Are you sure?
Won't your wife get mad at you?

12:36.000 --> 12:39.200
I'll tell her everything once
we bring the fruit back.

12:39.200 --> 12:43.920
Oh, the Princess's escort?
So she's your wife?

12:43.920 --> 12:45.980
Didn't Suzanne tell you?

12:45.980 --> 12:48.460
She just mentioned her name Sylphiette.

12:49.230 --> 12:51.660
So that's her, huh?
No wonder.

12:51.660 --> 12:53.310
And Roxy.

12:53.310 --> 12:55.310
The blue-haired demon girl's too.

12:55.310 --> 12:56.990
What, her too?

12:56.990 --> 13:00.970
Wasn't Roxy the one you told me before,
your magic teacher, right?

13:00.970 --> 13:02.090
That's right.

13:09.300 --> 13:14.180
Actually, I've been wanting
to apologize to you.

13:14.180 --> 13:17.210
You wanted to apologize to me?

13:17.210 --> 13:18.260
Yes.

13:18.260 --> 13:24.370
After we parted ways,
I found out about your illness.

13:24.880 --> 13:29.330
Back then, I acted like
I was the only one who got hurt

13:29.330 --> 13:31.940
and made you the bad guy.

13:35.780 --> 13:39.060
Maybe if I were more mature,
I would have realized it.

13:39.060 --> 13:42.370
You were hurt so badly
that you wanted to die.

13:44.930 --> 13:46.050
Sorry.

13:49.890 --> 13:52.640
I'm only realizing it now, actually.

13:52.640 --> 13:58.440
I think at that time I probably
didn't like you that much.

13:58.440 --> 14:00.030
Excuse me?

14:00.500 --> 14:04.810
The cause of my illness
was this girl named Eris.

14:04.810 --> 14:07.160
I felt abandoned by her.

14:07.610 --> 14:11.020
At that time,
you showed me your affection,

14:11.020 --> 14:16.170
so I thought about moving on
to put the past behind me.

14:16.170 --> 14:21.900
But it didn't go well, and I even said
mean things to protect myself.

14:21.900 --> 14:25.430
My feelings for you
weren't that sincere.

14:25.870 --> 14:29.160
So, you don't have to apologize.

14:29.160 --> 14:31.600
You've changed, haven't you?

14:31.600 --> 14:32.730
Really?

14:32.730 --> 14:33.800
Yes.

14:33.800 --> 14:37.940
The old you wouldn't have said that,
even if it was a lie.

14:37.940 --> 14:41.440
You've never talked to me
this casually before.

14:41.440 --> 14:43.020
That's true.

14:43.020 --> 14:47.620
Back then, I didn't get close to others
any more than was necessary.

14:47.620 --> 14:51.080
Because I was afraid of being hurt again.

14:51.080 --> 14:53.260
I didn't want to be hated.

14:53.260 --> 14:54.720
But now...

14:55.430 --> 14:57.330
Someone gave me this confidence.

14:57.330 --> 14:58.900
Your wife?

14:58.900 --> 14:59.950
Yeah.

14:59.950 --> 15:05.060
The one who cured my illness
wholeheartedly was Sylphie.

15:05.060 --> 15:07.830
Even though it was her first time,

15:07.830 --> 15:11.790
not just her body,
she even used aphrodisiacs.

15:11.790 --> 15:16.260
Wow, that is really amazing.

15:16.730 --> 15:21.470
If she did all that for you,
why'd you go and grab a second one?

15:21.470 --> 15:23.850
I'm sure people would think that.

15:23.850 --> 15:26.490
Roxy did the same thing for me.

15:26.990 --> 15:32.380
When I lost someone precious to me
and didn't care about anything else anymore,

15:32.380 --> 15:34.000
she came to save me.

15:34.640 --> 15:35.730
I see.

15:38.850 --> 15:41.690
I don't think I could have
done that for you.

15:41.690 --> 15:45.100
Even if I knew about
your illness back then.

15:45.630 --> 15:50.580
Maybe that's why you never
really fell for me.

15:53.960 --> 15:55.340
Maybe it was.

15:55.340 --> 15:58.690
Sylphie and Roxy both love me.

15:58.690 --> 16:02.610
But I love them even more.

16:02.610 --> 16:06.740
I think that's the difference between
them and Sara or other women.

16:11.090 --> 16:13.840
Look, don't get the wrong idea.

16:13.840 --> 16:16.520
My love ended that day.

16:16.520 --> 16:21.720
I do want to apologize for saying mean things
without knowing your situation,

16:21.720 --> 16:23.090
but that's all.

16:23.090 --> 16:26.840
It never even crossed my mind to have
another shot with you after all this time.

16:27.220 --> 16:31.720
So, stop looking at me like you
did something very bad to me.

16:32.820 --> 16:36.480
Just act normally as old
adventuring comrades.

16:40.600 --> 16:42.780
Okay, got it.

17:01.290 --> 17:02.250
Roxy!

17:27.990 --> 17:31.070
Princess Ariel, can we meet again?

17:31.070 --> 17:33.870
Yes, let's meet again sometime.

17:33.870 --> 17:38.400
I still want to learn more magic
from Big Sis Roxy!

17:38.400 --> 17:39.500
Well...

17:39.500 --> 17:43.330
Oh, how about joining our party?

17:43.330 --> 17:47.510
Thank you for the offer,
but I'm already full with my job here.

17:47.510 --> 17:48.760
I also have a husband.

17:48.760 --> 17:50.150
That won't be a problem!

17:50.150 --> 17:54.970
Left alone for a while, he'll spoil you
rotten when you show up again!

17:54.970 --> 17:57.770
Alisa, that's enough!

17:57.770 --> 17:59.350
Okay...

18:01.700 --> 18:04.450
All right, Rudeus.
Guess this is goodbye.

18:04.450 --> 18:06.640
Yeah. Stay safe out there.

18:06.640 --> 18:08.110
You too.

18:08.110 --> 18:10.780
It seems like your wives
are getting along,

18:10.780 --> 18:12.530
but don't you ever start comparing them.

18:12.530 --> 18:15.530
Y-Yes, I'll keep that in mind.

18:15.530 --> 18:16.910
Good!

18:18.400 --> 18:19.390
See you!

18:29.840 --> 18:33.850
Rudy, are you sure you want
to let her go like that?

18:33.850 --> 18:35.740
What do you mean?

18:35.740 --> 18:39.600
You used to be in love with her, right?

18:40.500 --> 18:44.310
I don't think I was actually
in love with her.

18:44.310 --> 18:48.230
We were a little awkward
with each other, that's all.

18:48.230 --> 18:51.300
Oh, I see.

18:53.490 --> 18:56.410
So, Rudy, what kind of girl do you like?

18:57.550 --> 19:00.110
I want to know, too!

19:02.730 --> 19:04.910
Let's see...

19:04.910 --> 19:10.380
I think I'd fall for girls
who saved me from crisis.

19:10.380 --> 19:12.030
Then...

19:14.050 --> 19:18.140
Does that mean we're special?

19:18.140 --> 19:21.210
Yeah, both of you are special to me.

19:22.880 --> 19:27.400
There aren't that many girls who've
helped me when I'm in trouble.

19:27.870 --> 19:31.840
So, there's no need for you
to get anxious, Sylphie.

19:31.840 --> 19:34.280
I won't take any more wives
than you two.

19:34.780 --> 19:36.250
I promise.

19:36.250 --> 19:37.230
Yes.

19:37.230 --> 19:38.990
But, Rudy...

19:38.990 --> 19:42.040
If there's a girl that you think is special,

19:42.040 --> 19:44.910
and she thinks you're special to her,

19:44.910 --> 19:48.040
I don't mind if you bring
two or three more girls.

19:48.040 --> 19:49.420
Special...

19:52.480 --> 19:54.790
She had abandoned me.

19:54.790 --> 20:00.110
But Ruijerd said that it must have
been a misunderstanding.

20:02.260 --> 20:06.430
Sylphie, I don't know what
will happen in the future,

20:06.430 --> 20:09.400
I might end up breaking
that promise again.

20:10.850 --> 20:11.880
That's okay.

20:13.020 --> 20:17.270
Just make sure
you bring her to us first.

20:17.270 --> 20:23.400
There's no way I can allow some girl
who doesn't even love you to marry you.

20:23.400 --> 20:24.410
Yeah.

20:24.930 --> 20:26.740
Promise me this.

20:26.740 --> 20:32.730
If you have hidden mistresses and end up
having children with them,

20:32.730 --> 20:34.070
even I would...

20:34.070 --> 20:35.670
Y-Yes, Ma'am!

20:37.310 --> 20:42.930
All right, I'm looking forward to seeing
what kind of girl you would bring home.

20:44.680 --> 20:48.810
Your swordmanship has already
surpassed the level of Sword Saint.

20:48.810 --> 20:52.810
It's time to welcome a new Sword King
since Ghislaine.

20:52.810 --> 20:54.650
Before that, I have a question.

20:54.650 --> 20:57.960
The Longsword of Light is the best
technique of the Sword God style.

20:57.960 --> 21:01.600
And there are levels
in mastering its essence.

21:01.600 --> 21:06.430
Sword Saint, Sword King,
Sword Emperor, and Sword God.

21:06.430 --> 21:09.330
What do you think
the differences are, Gino?

21:09.330 --> 21:13.410
Besides the technique itself,
maybe footwork or muscle control.

21:13.410 --> 21:16.370
Or perhaps the quality of the weapon?

21:16.370 --> 21:17.710
Weapon quality?!

21:17.710 --> 21:19.750
How many years have you
been training for?

21:19.750 --> 21:21.750
M-My apologies!

21:21.750 --> 21:24.340
You don't understand because
you're still just a kid, huh?

21:24.340 --> 21:28.760
Oh well, even if you don't understand,
the strong will always be strong.

21:28.760 --> 21:31.480
Okay, Nina. Answer that.

21:32.250 --> 21:33.980
Is it desire?

21:34.870 --> 21:37.900
You sure have started
to look more feminine lately.

21:38.400 --> 21:42.020
Then, how long can your desire last?

21:42.020 --> 21:44.080
What do you mean by that?

21:44.080 --> 21:45.500
For example...

21:45.500 --> 21:48.480
Between marrying Gino
and becoming a Sword King,

21:48.480 --> 21:51.560
which would you choose
if I told you that you have to choose?

21:53.560 --> 21:55.290
I'd choose becoming Sword King.

21:56.400 --> 21:59.260
Naive as ever.

21:59.260 --> 22:01.380
What about you, Eris?

22:01.970 --> 22:02.880
Determination.

22:02.880 --> 22:06.050
Determination?
Nope, that's wrong.

22:06.050 --> 22:09.060
I'm sure of it.
It's determination.

22:09.060 --> 22:12.100
Then you don't care if you can't
become a Sword King?

22:12.100 --> 22:14.090
That doesn't matter to me.

22:14.090 --> 22:16.120
I thought you wanted to get stronger?

22:16.120 --> 22:18.190
Yes, I do.

22:18.190 --> 22:20.900
But a title doesn't change
how strong a person is, does it?

22:22.070 --> 22:24.450
All right, Eris and Nina.

22:24.450 --> 22:28.200
Whoever wins between you two
will be named Sword King.

22:30.910 --> 22:34.430
This brings back memories
of the first time you came here.

22:34.430 --> 22:35.830
Right.

22:35.830 --> 22:37.590
Today, I will be the winner.

22:43.090 --> 22:44.840
Rudeus...

22:58.860 --> 23:00.970
How long are you two going
to stare at each other?

23:08.440 --> 23:09.370
That's enough!

23:14.370 --> 23:16.380
Are you frustrated, Nina?

23:16.890 --> 23:18.120
Yes.

23:18.120 --> 23:19.790
You still can grow stronger.

23:19.790 --> 23:21.310
Train harder.

23:22.620 --> 23:24.790
Yes, Father.

23:26.660 --> 23:28.050
Well done, Eris.

23:28.850 --> 23:31.410
I give you the title of Sword King.

23:32.060 --> 23:35.050
EPISODE 6
ANOTHER CRISIS?

23:35.050 --> 23:40.060
NEXT EPISODE
PHASE FOUR
